gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Is this thing on? Stupid camera's...\p"
	.string "There we go... Ahum...\p"
	.string "HI THERE ASPIRING TRAINER!\p"
	.string "DO YOU HAVE GOOD REFERENCES?\p"
	.string "Arghh... who cares... damnit...\p"
	.string "CAN YOU LIFT BOXES?\p"
	.string "Excellent!\p"
	.string "I, Professor BIRDS, am offering one\n"
	.string " - ONE - summer internship position\l"
	.string " at my research laboratory in\l"
	.string " ERPUS CITY.\p"
	.string "The work is CRITICAL.\n"
	.string "The pay is... less critical...\p"
	.string "But I will, in my generosity,\n"
	.string "provide you with your very own POKéMON.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::

	.string "Behold! A magnificent Magikarp.\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "It's rare.\p"
	.string "Don't look it up...\p"
	.string "My lab is engaged in research\n"
	.string "of the highest importance.\p"
	.string "I cannot tell you what it is.\p"
	.string "Not yet.\n"
	.string "Possibly not ever.\p"
	.string "What I CAN tell you is that\n"
	.string "it involves PIG SENSORS.\p"
	.string "They detect things.\n"
	.string "Important things.\p"
	.string "Things that GOVERNMENTS don't\n"
	.string "want detected.\p"
	.string "That is all I will say.\n"
	.string "That is all ANYONE should say.\p"
	.string "If someone asks you about the\n"
	.string "pig sensors - and they will -\p"
	.string "you say: I don't know what\n"
	.string "those are.\p"
	.string "Even if you do know.\n"
	.string "ESPECIALLY if you do know.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "Anyways. Now I need to know...\n"
	.string "well, legally I need to know\l"
	.string "something about you.\p"
	.string "For the grant... \l"
	.string "I mean your CONTRACT ofcourse!\p"
	.string "I'm sorry. Old habits.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "So. Male or Female?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "Good. Now I need your name on the\n"
	.string "applica... contract.\p"
	.string "The REAL one. Not a nickname.\n"
	.string "Not a username.\p"
	.string "Everyone has fake names nowadays.\p"
	.string "I will NOT have that nonsense in my\n"
	.string "lab.\p"
	.string "Also HR needs it.\n"
	.string "Coincindence, I'm the HR manager!\p"
	.string "What can I put down on my appli...\n"
	.string "your contract!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Fine. {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "You're hired.\p"
	.string "Unpaid.\n"
	.string "Don't tell anyone.\p"
	.string "Be at my lab in ERPUS CITY.\n"
	.string "July 14th.\p"
	.string "7AM sharp.\p"
	.string "Not 7:01.\n"
	.string "Not 6:59.\p"
	.string "I will not be awake at 6:59.\p"
	.string "Oh btw. Do not go through the door\n"
	.string "at the back.\p"
	.string "Because... there is no door at the back.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "HONEY! HONEY! WAKE UP!\p"
	.string "$"